            <ArticleTitle>Osteoarthritis: pathogenesis, clinical features and management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Osteoarthritis is a degenerative disorder of the synovial joints that is characterised by joint pain, stiffness and limited range of movement. The majority of nurses will encounter patients with this condition even though this might not be the reason they are seeking health care. This article discusses the associated signs and symptoms, investigations, diagnosis and treatment of this condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
